# nauvis.surface: the surface of this run. Where the plots go is the world design, nauvis.fk; this
# file holds what is true of the world itself: the ground, the starter kit's claim, and how the
# game watches what is built outside your design.
surface  nauvis
mode     play                                   # fair play: you see where you look; alerts come to you
terrain  map                                    # map.terrain.json: the bare ground, read at kickoff
catalog  base
design   nauvis.fk                              # the plots: the plant and your world

claim kit box 2,6 23,21 "the starter kit: roboport, solar panels, accumulators, poles, six chests"

watch plots:      keep
watch sanctioned: mark 2h
notify            nearby
